Better Search (Case-Insensitive)

Replace:

Python
cursor.execute(
"SELECT * FROM students WHERE name=?",
(name,)
)

with:

Python
cursor.execute(
"SELECT * FROM students WHERE LOWER(name)=LOWER(?)",
(name,)
)

Now all of these will work:

Plain Text
Hyarel
hyarel
HYAREL
hYaReL
Verify Your Search Route

Your /search route should look like:

Python
@app.route("/search")
def search():
 
name = request.args.get("name")
 
conn = sqlite3.connect("students.db")
 
cursor = conn.cursor()
 
cursor.execute(
"SELECT * FROM students WHERE LOWER(name)=LOWER(?)",
(name,)
)
 
rows = cursor.fetchall()
 
conn.close()
 
return str(rows)
